15:'Convert every confirmed failure in this job into a permanent regression definition plus a separate actual pre-correction regression execution. In the regressions record, preserve only the durable definition: failure fixture and identity/hash claim when available, reproduction procedure, detection method, correction expectation, applicability, and permanent test location. In regressionExecutions, return PHASE = PRE_CORRECTION and the actual RESULT for the execution that demonstrates the failure, with canonical evidence supplied through the normal evidence linkage. Do not write PRE_CORRECTION_RESULT, PRE_CORRECTION_EVIDENCE, POST_CORRECTION_RESULT, or POST_CORRECTION_EVIDENCE on the regression definition; those compatibility summary fields are application-owned and are not execution authority. The application assigns REG_ID and lifecycle state. Do not claim post-correction success at Stage 15; that success must come from an actual later regressionExecutions record.',
